  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>靈感來自於我做過的一個噩夢。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_71b67515-0757-4665-8330-3ac5bc5dd930.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a;text-decoration:underline\"><strong>本模組包含令人不安的內容、突襲驚嚇與巨大聲響！]</strong></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a;text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">為了讓模組正常運作，遊戲語言必須設定為英文（原版），否則單人遊戲按鈕將不會顯示。</span></strong></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#ba372a\"><strong>本模組最終會讓你的世界無法遊玩！</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#ba372a\"><strong>請開啟環境音效！！！</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#ba372a\"><strong>這不是棲居者模組！！！</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#ba372a\"><strong>需要安裝 GeckoLib 模組！！！</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#ba372a\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_6b688c46-8351-4c40-800b-2b4d20335766.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong>樹後，它靜靜等待著我，</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong>蒼白的雙眼無聲閃爍。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong>我曾在家旁瞥見它的身影，</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong>如今我再也不獨行。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong>三次機會——這就是我的全部，</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong>&nbsp;兩次已逝，難以忘懷。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong>&nbsp;每當夜幕低垂，它便悄然逼近……</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><del style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong>而現在我知道，它一直都在這裡。</strong></span></del></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_95377d20-2824-40f0-85ce-b2731b253d14.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"686\" height=\"58\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">&bull; 盡量在日落前蓋好房子。不需要太大，6x8 的大小就足夠了。</span></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">&bull;</span></span></strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong>不要靠得太近。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">&bull;</span></span> 不要挑戰它。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">&bull;</span></span> 絕對不要靠得太近。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">&bull;</span></span> 你可以在 YouTube 影片中使用此模組，但請務必註明出處！</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">&bull;</span></span> 玩得開心 :) </strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">這是我的第一個模組，拜託給個機會吧！</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
